
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Thank You | Levi Runfola</title>
    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e1e2f 0%, #11111b 100%);
            color: #ffffff;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            height: 100vh;
        }
        .card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            padding: 2.5rem;
            border-radius: 16px;
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 500px;
            width: 90%;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
        }
        .icon {
            font-size: 3rem;
            color: #4caf50;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }
        h1 {
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            color: #f1f1f1;
        }
        p {
            color: #b3b3b3;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }
        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #00adb5;
            color: #fff;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 0.8rem 2rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: bold;
            transition: background 0.3s ease;
        }
        .btn:hover {
            background: #007a80;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="card">
        <div class="icon">✓</div>
        <h1>Thanks Received!</h1>
        <p>
            Thank you, <strong><%= contact.firstName %> <%= contact.lastName %></strong>. 
        </p>
        <a href="/" class="btn">Back to Portfolio</a>
    </div>

</body>
</html>